  "research_conclusions": [
    "Two distinct Vienna Reichshofrat cases have explicit catalog signatures and are NOT the same as one individual's denominational-rights case.",
    "Antiqua Band 4 Akte 858 is listed with 3429 folios, across five K-number subfiles. Index folio positions belong to the respective subfiles and must not be treated as manuscript pages read.",
