    "1661-08-13 non-Catholic reporting refers to a norm transmitted by an eighteenth-century copy. No actual arrest, expulsion or §35 individual ruling was confirmed.",
    "1661-08-18 Hospitalsherren and Sterbherren are administrative roles from regest; no specific patient or burial legal verdict was observed.",
    "Reichshofrat digital inventories may be searched for free, but full digitized texts need a subscription. No full-file text was copied.",
    "1661-03-07 and 1661-03-17 indicate a legal opinion and its subsequent approval/modification, not an automatically executed judgment.",
